==Trivia==
*The 9 years it took for her to read every book in the royal library is about the length of the time between the initial release of [[Nyanko Daisensou]] and [[Version 10.6 Update|Version 10.6]], as well as how long [[Dark Priest Mamon|Mamon]] was scheming to take over [[The Aku Realms]].
*Even though Princess Cat and [[Cat Princess (Special Cat)|Cat Princess]] may appear to have the same name in Japanese, that is not the case, as they use different words for "princess" (Princess Cat is ネコ王女 Neko Ōjo, Cat Princess is ネコひめ Neko Hime).
*Princess Cat is referenced by [[Aku Researcher (Rare Cat)|Evil Aku Researcher]], whose sign reads as upside-down katakana that translates to: "''Cat Queen opens the door to the Demon World''".
*Princess Cat's EN description has a typo in it. Instead of ''"a 9-year old genius has memorized the '''entirely''' of the royal libraries"'', it should be ''"a 9-year old genius has memorized the '''entirety'''  of the royal libraries"''.

